  {
   "id": "system",
   "x": -330,
   "y": -260,
   "w": 300,
   "text": "THE SYSTEM\n\nOne typeface (Plus Jakarta Sans).\nOne accent (#1F6B3F).\nNo shadows anywhere \u2014 depth is a white card on a warm ground plus the gutter.\nEverything else is spacing.\n\nThe one signature: an interest is a coloured WORD, never a chip or a badge."
  },
  {
   "id": "brief",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -260,
   "w": 560,
   "text": "THE WHOLE APP, twenty screens in one language.\n\nFeed is Xiaohongshu's two-column waterfall \u2014 image height drives card height, four to five posts on screen, no sections. The feed is ranked server-side and the UI never mentions it.\n\nEvery tap target is at least 44px. Card titles are 13.5px semibold at 18px line height. Nothing meta drops below 11.5px. Type scales with the platform font setting."
  },
  {
   "id": "open",
   "x": 620,
   "y": -260,
   "w": 460,
   "text": "THREE THINGS STILL OPEN\n\n1. Media is a soft gradient, not a photograph. Real images change the balance of every card and are the first thing to drop in.\n2. The constitution: Principle I is NON-NEGOTIABLE and FR-033 has a negative test. A ranked blended feed replaces both, so /speckit-constitution comes before any spec.\n3. Ranking picks candidates; VisibilityFilter must still decide at read time, or a block stops landing immediately."
  }
 ],
